Instructions to build and install VIAXFG
========================================

You will need the DJGPP compiler and some UNIX tools to build VIAXFG. 

DJGPP for DOS can be obtained from https://www.delorie.com/djgpp/.

You can alternatively use the DJGPP cross-compiler for Windows, Linux or Mac from https://github.com/andrewwutw/build-djgpp. On Windows, you would additionally need a UNIX shell like MSYS or MSYS2, or if you really must, CYGWIN. 

Building VIAXFG
---------------

VIAXFG uses GNU Makefiles.

1. To build VIAXFG, from the project directory run:

make all

2. To do a clean build, from the project directory run:

make clean all

After compilation you will find the VIAXFG executable in the project directory.


